tring ｜ undefined</code></td></tr><tr><td><strong>Default</strong></td><td><code>undefined</code></td></tr></tbody></table></div>"},{"kind":"heading","level":3,"id":"prop-name","text":"name"},{"kind":"html","html":"<div class=\"tableWrapper_flOe\"><table><tbody><tr><td><strong>Description</strong></td><td>The name of the control, which is submitted with the form data.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Attribute</strong></td><td><code>name</code></td></tr><tr><td><strong>Type</strong></td><td><code>string</code></td></tr><tr><td><strong>Default</strong></td><td><code>this.inputId</code></td></tr></tbody></table></div>"},{"kind":"heading","level":3,"id":"prop-value","text":"value"},{"kind":"html","html":"<div class=\"tableWrapper_flOe\"><table><tbody><tr><td><strong>Description</strong></td><td>the value of the radio group.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Attribute</strong></td><td><code>value</code></td></tr><tr><td><strong>Type</strong></td><td><code>any</code></td></tr><tr><td><strong>Default</strong></td><td><code>undefined</code></td></tr></tbody></table></div>"},{"kind":"heading","level":2,"id":"events","text":"Events"},{"kind":"html","html":"<div class=\"tableWrapper_flOe\"><table><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Description</th><th>Bubbles</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>ionChange</code></td><td>Emitted when the value has changed.<br><br>This event will not emit when programmatically setting the <code>value</code> property.</td><td><code>true</code></td></tr></tbody></table></div>"},{"kind":"heading","level":2,"id":"methods","text":"Methods"},{"kind":"html","html":"<p>No public methods available for this component.</p>"},{"kind":"heading","level":2,"id":"css-shadow-parts","text":"CSS Shadow Parts"},{"kind":"html","html":"<p>No CSS shadow parts available for this component.</p>"},{"kind":"heading","level":2,"id":"css-custom-properties","text":"CSS Custom Properties"},{"kind":"html","html":"<p>No CSS custom properties available for this component.</p>"},{"kind":"heading","leve